#HELP_BEGIN
This SIMPL+ module translates digital up and down control signals into formatted string commands for transmission to a KNX network.

Here is how the module operates:

* **Initialization:** Upon startup, it builds a base command prefix by taking the user-defined `GroupAddress` parameter and appending `:1:` to it.

* **Up Action:** When the `Up_tp` digital input goes high (1), it appends `"09;"` to the base prefix and transmits the full string out the `To_KNX_TX$` output.

* **Down Action:** When the `Down_tp` digital input goes high (1), it appends `"01;"` to the prefix and transmits the resulting string.

* **Stop/Release Action:** When either input is released (transitions to 0), the module checks the status of the opposite input. If both `Up_tp` and `Down_tp` are at 0, it transmits a `"00;"` command to signal a stop or release action.


/*******************************************************************************************
  DIGITAL, ANALOG and SERIAL INPUTS and OUTPUTS
  (Uncomment and declare inputs and outputs as needed)
*******************************************************************************************/
DIGITAL_INPUT	_SKIP_;			DIGITAL_OUTPUT	_SKIP_;
DIGITAL_INPUT 	Up_tp;			STRING_OUTPUT To_KNX_TX$;
DIGITAL_INPUT	Down_tp;			DIGITAL_OUTPUT _SKIP_;

/*******************************************************************************************
  Parameters
  (Uncomment and declare parameters as needed)
*******************************************************************************************/
// INTEGER_PARAMETER
// SIGNED_INTEGER_PARAMETER
// LONG_INTEGER_PARAMETER
// SIGNED_LONG_INTEGER_PARAMETER
STRING_PARAMETER GroupAddress[9];

/*******************************************************************************************
  Parameter Properties
  (Uncomment and declare parameter properties as needed)
*******************************************************************************************/
#BEGIN_PARAMETER_PROPERTIES GroupAddress
   propDefaultValue="";
#END_PARAMETER_PROPERTIES

STRING Prefix[14];
INTEGER PrefixLen;

CHANGE Up_tp
{
	if( Up_tp = 1 )
		To_KNX_TX$ = Prefix + "09;";
	else if( Down_tp = 0 )
		To_KNX_TX$ = Prefix + "00;";
}

CHANGE Down_tp
{
	if( Down_tp = 1 )
		To_KNX_TX$ = Prefix + "01;";
	else if( Up_tp = 0 )
		To_KNX_TX$ = Prefix + "00;";
}

/*******************************************************************************************
  Main()
  Uncomment and place one-time startup code here
  (This code will get called when the system starts up)
*******************************************************************************************/
Function Main()
{
    // TODO:  Add code here
    // Initialize declared global and local variables/arrays as needed.

    WaitForInitializationComplete();
	Prefix = GroupAddress + ":1:";
	PrefixLen = len(Prefix);
}

